WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.340
Every answer. Four second places.

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:05.740
In RecoScope's November 21st
running-shoe snapshot,

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.840
Brooks appeared in all 12
usable answers.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.560
Yet all four comparisons
ranked it second.

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:15.940
ASICS appeared in 10 answers
and ranked first in every comparison.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.760
Four assistants answered
three saved prompts

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:21.820
for a U.S. man running
3–4 times a week for fitness.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:26.060
Brooks and Saucony appeared in
every under-$150 answer.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:30.080
Some listed shoes cost exactly
$150 before tax.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:33.200
A mention isn't a verified
under-budget offer.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:37.180
On November 16th, ASICS also
ranked first four times.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:40.140
Two dated captures are not
a controlled trend.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:43.120
For your brand, track mentions
and ranks separately.

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:47.160
These findings describe captured
answers, not product quality.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:50.300
Explore benchmark at
getrecoscope.com.
